    "problem_statement": "When per-channel maximum transmit powers are configured and the radio coprocessor is later recovered or restarted (restoration of saved properties), the previously configured per-channel max transmit powers are not restored back to the coprocessor, so each channel loses its individually configured power and falls back to the table default. Additionally, a coprocessor firmware that does not support the per-channel max power property should be tolerated gracefully on recovery rather than treated as a fatal error, and unconfigured channels should not have default powers pushed to the coprocessor on every recovery.",
